 "note": "S, 13 platforms, choke, inward. A 6-way meat grinder: a hexagon of platforms round a rotor hub whose three bridges (120 degrees apart) turn 60 degrees every fire - bottom centre + top sides, then top centre + bottom sides - so the hub is always connected and every turn kills whatever is on its bridges (review 2026-09-29; short bridges so the hexagon fits). Two lanes per side feed the hexagon. Survivor ring: the hub and the hexagon.",
